  <data name="HelpText" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Sets the keyboard layout, color scheme and displays of the login screen, which everyone sees before they log in. The Copy menu fills the form in from your own settings. Nothing changes until you press Apply, which asks for an administrator's password and saves the settings to /etc/wlrix/greeter.toml. Use System Defaults removes that file, and the login screen goes back to /etc/wlrix/compositor.toml.</value>
